        <mxCell id="c132" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the WINDOW line, the one change from the model script (MarginPct in place of UnitMargin), and the run of five Furniture items at 55.0%: all share RANK 6 and DENSE_RANK 5, while ROW_NUMBER counts 6 to 10, in an order the query does not control. The top two items tie as well, at 55.5%. Over the 223 items the three columns disagree on 183, and RANK keeps 16 rows for the top three where ROW_NUMBER keeps 15. The grid is scrolled to rows 57 to 66, the first rows of Furniture, and the editor to the Ranked CTE.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="776" width="860" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
